# Files exposed read-only at /AOK/docs/book, embedded into the kernel by
# tools/gen-aokfs.py at build time (see meson.build / fs/aok.c).
#
# One path per line, relative to docs/book/. Blank lines and lines starting
# with # are ignored. Paths may nest (appendices/), and the intermediate
# directory nodes are derived from them rather than declared here.
#
# This is the book that lives in docs/book/ in the repository. It ships on the
# device because a reader with a terminal and no browser is exactly who it was
# written for.
